  <p id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南康愍王<persName id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p001:m0004" ref="eaj_zin_zxy_A">曇朗</persName>，高祖母弟忠壯王<persName id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p001:m0014" ref="eaj_zin_zxy">休先</persName>之子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p002:m0002" ref="eaj_zin_zxy_A">曇朗</persName>未質於齊，生子<persName id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p002:m0011" ref="eaj_zin_zxy_AA">方泰</persName>、<persName id="c-chenshu-014-fangqing-family-context:p002:m0014" ref="eaj_zin_zxy_AB">方慶</persName>。</p>
